WEBVTT

00:00:00.210 --> 00:00:04.980
Departure

00:00:52.560 --> 00:00:54.390
<i>What's this breathing I hear?</i>

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:57.430
<i>Amuro Ray?</i>

00:00:57.500 --> 00:00:58.660
<i>Lalah Sune?</i>

00:01:01.900 --> 00:01:03.340
<i>No, it's neither.</i>

00:01:48.580 --> 00:01:51.810
I cannot forgive those soldiers!

00:01:56.390 --> 00:02:00.120
What was... that breathing I heard?

00:02:00.190 --> 00:02:01.590
Roberto! Apolly!

00:02:01.660 --> 00:02:03.890
We're going in to capture
the Gundam Mk. Il!

00:02:07.070 --> 00:02:09.000
They go around
bragging that they're Titans...

00:02:09.200 --> 00:02:13.070
...but what good is an army
that only enlists those born on Earth?

00:02:23.050 --> 00:02:24.380
Lieutenant Jerid Messa!

00:02:24.450 --> 00:02:28.650
I'm certain you were well aware
that your unwise actions would lead to this.

00:02:28.960 --> 00:02:31.980
Naturally, I'd be a little hasty
knowing another pilot's been selected.

00:02:32.360 --> 00:02:35.990
Besides, I just obeyed Captain Bask's
orders to prepare myself for combat.

00:02:36.330 --> 00:02:38.390
That's still no reason to do what you did
in a residential zone...

00:02:38.470 --> 00:02:40.730
...where low-altitude flight is prohibited!

00:02:40.800 --> 00:02:43.670
Lieutenant Emma. You're talking
like you're my superior! You're not!

00:02:43.740 --> 00:02:47.940
We're also told to improve our skill
with the mobile suits.

00:02:48.210 --> 00:02:50.010
I didn't damage the Mk. II.

00:02:50.080 --> 00:02:53.670
Too bad we can't say the same for
that building you crushed.

00:02:54.080 --> 00:02:57.780
That happened because I tried
to avoid a civilian complex!

00:02:58.450 --> 00:02:59.850
What are you doing here?!

00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:01.750
Can't you hear the alarms?

00:03:01.990 --> 00:03:03.320
Captain Bright?!

00:03:03.560 --> 00:03:06.420
I'll bet a meteorite opened a hole
in the colony or something.

00:03:06.890 --> 00:03:09.190
What would someone like you know?!

00:03:09.360 --> 00:03:10.800
Since you just arrived from Earth!

00:03:12.170 --> 00:03:13.760
Are you saying the A. E. U. G. are attacking?

00:03:14.300 --> 00:03:15.560
I'm not sure!

00:03:15.640 --> 00:03:17.070
I'm just saying be prepared for it!

00:03:19.610 --> 00:03:22.200
- Lieutenant, where are you going?
- Lieutenant Jerid!

00:03:22.280 --> 00:03:24.040
I'm handling the situation,
as you ordered, sir!

00:03:24.780 --> 00:03:26.440
Check the third unit! Go!

00:03:26.510 --> 00:03:28.210
Where are you going?!

00:03:28.280 --> 00:03:31.310
From the Titans point of view,
the A. E. U. G. are a group we must fight!

00:03:31.620 --> 00:03:33.140
But we're unclear on the situation!

00:03:33.220 --> 00:03:34.980
I said I'll handle the situation!

00:03:40.890 --> 00:03:42.890
But we haven't determined
the whereabouts of the Gundam yet.

00:03:50.900 --> 00:03:53.170
Lieutenant! I hope you know
what you're doing!

00:03:53.310 --> 00:03:55.800
A little damage to the colony
cannot be avoided! We've come this far.

00:03:55.880 --> 00:03:58.070
We can't leave now,
having seen only a glimpse of a Mk. Il!

00:04:03.920 --> 00:04:08.220
When will the Federation Forces realize
that this place is not part of Earth?!

00:04:23.500 --> 00:04:24.630
Clark!

00:04:25.240 --> 00:04:27.210
Why can't our shots hit the enemy?!

00:04:30.680 --> 00:04:31.650
They're fast!

00:04:35.720 --> 00:04:37.950
There's no way I can catch up to it
with such an antique GM!

00:04:58.440 --> 00:05:00.530
The Red Comet?! That's ludicrous!

00:05:03.610 --> 00:05:05.580
Is that a new model?

00:05:06.410 --> 00:05:09.010
- When did you manufacture it?!
- You can tell by looking at it...

00:05:09.080 --> 00:05:10.910
...that it wasn't built
by the Captain's orders!

00:05:10.980 --> 00:05:12.540
Huh? Then...?

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:14.020
The A. E. U. G...

00:05:14.920 --> 00:05:16.620
But why to Green Noa 1?

00:05:17.020 --> 00:05:19.190
They're probably here to gather data
on the Gundam Mk. II.

00:05:19.630 --> 00:05:21.990
They can have the data on it if they wish.

00:05:22.460 --> 00:05:25.520
Lieutenant Bidan! I don't appreciate
such inappropriate comments.

00:05:25.600 --> 00:05:27.360
What's going on with the Mk. II?

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:28.300
Well...!

00:05:28.370 --> 00:05:30.360
We can't allow the enemy to escape.

00:05:30.440 --> 00:05:32.410
They've seen the facilities.

00:05:33.010 --> 00:05:35.870
- Major! I'm going to Green Noa 1!
- Yes, sir!

00:05:35.940 --> 00:05:37.880
I can't even see the battle from here!

00:05:51.390 --> 00:05:53.360
You think you're much better, don't you?!

00:06:01.030 --> 00:06:03.630
He's too fast! He's just like the Red Comet!

00:06:06.870 --> 00:06:08.600
Apolly, Roberto!

00:06:08.680 --> 00:06:10.140
Keep up with me!

00:06:34.430 --> 00:06:36.490
What is going on here?

00:06:36.570 --> 00:06:38.160
Mom?! Mom!

00:06:41.280 --> 00:06:42.970
Fa! Thank goodness you're safe.
We're evacuating.

00:06:43.040 --> 00:06:44.910
I've already packed your stuff.

00:07:01.660 --> 00:07:02.530
It's here!

00:07:02.830 --> 00:07:05.090
It's Mk. Il! Apolly, are you watching?!

00:07:05.630 --> 00:07:07.330
Lieutenant Quattro, it's a Mk. Il!

00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:09.490
Roberto, cover us!

00:07:12.270 --> 00:07:13.710
Why is this happening?

00:07:13.770 --> 00:07:16.270
Why are the Federation Force's
mobile suits being attacked?

00:07:16.840 --> 00:07:20.510
This place is hated by all Spacenoids
living in outer space after all.

00:07:20.580 --> 00:07:23.710
But we never approved the plan
to make this place a Titan base...

00:07:28.790 --> 00:07:31.950
Mom, go ahead without me!
I'm going to check Kamille's place!

00:07:32.030 --> 00:07:33.990
- Fa!
- I'll be there shortly.

00:07:34.060 --> 00:07:35.030
Fa!

00:07:40.830 --> 00:07:42.170
Freeze!

00:07:42.740 --> 00:07:44.830
What are you doing here?

00:07:44.910 --> 00:07:46.930
Hey, it's Kamille!

00:07:47.010 --> 00:07:49.070
- Do you know him?
- Yeah!

00:07:49.140 --> 00:07:51.270
There seems to be an air raid in progress,
so I'm on my way to see my dad.

00:07:51.550 --> 00:07:52.910
We don't know what's going on.

00:07:52.980 --> 00:07:54.140
- What do you mean air raid?
- Hey!

00:07:54.410 --> 00:07:56.410
- Let him go!
- But...!

00:07:56.680 --> 00:07:58.620
He's Lieutenant Franklin's son.

00:07:58.690 --> 00:08:00.150
Aren't you more concerned
about the air raid?!

00:08:00.220 --> 00:08:01.740
Better not be a problem.

00:08:06.730 --> 00:08:08.790
I hope you both understand.

00:08:08.860 --> 00:08:10.730
If possible, we want to capture it
without a scratch!

00:08:12.900 --> 00:08:15.200
We're going straight into battle without
even a warm up simulation session?!

00:08:26.010 --> 00:08:28.610
Send Unit 3 out as soon as you're done
with the check!

00:08:29.250 --> 00:08:31.220
Have you arranged for a pilot?!

00:08:31.550 --> 00:08:34.020
Is the Captain of the Temptation
taking command?!

00:08:34.090 --> 00:08:35.990
Locales are unimportant
when it comes to actual battle!

00:08:36.060 --> 00:08:37.610
- You're late!
- I'm sorry, sir!

00:08:38.090 --> 00:08:40.220
Lieutenant Emma Sheen. You?

00:08:40.630 --> 00:08:43.460
The main objective of Titans is to
eliminate remaining Zeon soldiers.

00:08:43.530 --> 00:08:45.090
And I'm a member of Titans.

00:08:45.170 --> 00:08:48.290
But I understand that you haven't had
sufficient training.

00:08:48.740 --> 00:08:51.300
Our training has been like actual combat,
so we possess adaptable fighting potential.

00:08:51.370 --> 00:08:52.600
Please be assured!

00:08:53.070 --> 00:08:54.270
Hey. Who are you?!

00:08:55.610 --> 00:08:56.410
Wait!

00:09:01.050 --> 00:09:03.240
What's taking so long?
Can't you send out Unit 3 yet?!

00:09:05.650 --> 00:09:07.680
That's the guy! The guy I cannot forgive!

00:09:07.750 --> 00:09:09.020
- Hey, you!
- Shut up!

00:09:09.420 --> 00:09:11.050
Think first about where you're landing!

00:09:11.120 --> 00:09:12.060
Hey!

00:09:12.130 --> 00:09:13.850
What are you trying to do?!

00:09:14.060 --> 00:09:15.050
Don't touch Unit 3!

00:09:19.030 --> 00:09:20.120
You, there!

00:09:20.370 --> 00:09:22.030
Be careful!

00:09:22.100 --> 00:09:25.130
He knows the Gundam Mk. II?
Who is this kid?

00:09:26.740 --> 00:09:28.000
The power's on...!

00:09:31.950 --> 00:09:33.500
Where'd that guy go?!

00:09:35.050 --> 00:09:36.880
Get out of there! It's dangerous!

00:09:36.950 --> 00:09:38.510
- Isn't he coming out?!
- Commander...

00:09:38.590 --> 00:09:40.450
You can hear me, right?! Open the hatch!

00:09:42.820 --> 00:09:46.280
I never expected the data I got
from Dad's computer would come in so handy.

00:09:46.890 --> 00:09:49.360
- Lieutenant Emma! Get down.
- Huh?

00:10:01.910 --> 00:10:03.070
<i>Get off at once!</i>

00:10:03.140 --> 00:10:05.010
<i>This machine isn't that simple to operate!</i>

00:10:05.080 --> 00:10:07.910
What's this nonsense?!
The enemy is nearby!

00:10:07.980 --> 00:10:09.850
The guy on it isn't our regular pilot!

00:10:09.920 --> 00:10:12.410
Well, there's no way that
an amateur can operate it!

00:10:16.420 --> 00:10:17.250
Stop this at once!

00:10:17.320 --> 00:10:19.050
This isn't something that a child
should be operating!

00:10:21.830 --> 00:10:23.960
You could get hurt! Please stay outside!

00:10:25.300 --> 00:10:27.270
- That guy!
- That child is serious, Commander!

00:10:27.530 --> 00:10:29.870
<i>I'm sorry, Lieutenant Emma!</i>
<i>Commander Bright!</i>

00:10:44.420 --> 00:10:46.320
Does the boy know how to operate it?!

00:11:02.100 --> 00:11:06.130
<i>He's another Amuro!</i>
<i>If he's actually piloting it, that is.</i>

00:11:14.280 --> 00:11:16.980
- Lieutenant! There's one more unit!
- One more unit?!

00:11:18.990 --> 00:11:22.050
A red mobile suit?!
Just like the Red Comet!

00:11:22.560 --> 00:11:25.320
It doesn't look operational.
We're taking it!

00:11:26.190 --> 00:11:28.130
Jerid! Aren't you on it?!

00:11:28.360 --> 00:11:30.890
The enemy's trying to take
Unit 2 with them!

00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:31.930
Jerid!

00:11:32.230 --> 00:11:34.530
<i>Jerid! Why won't you help?!</i>

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:38.470
<i>No one's targeted me yet. That's great.</i>

00:11:38.540 --> 00:11:40.730
<i>I couldn't handle that red mobile suit...</i>

00:11:42.910 --> 00:11:44.770
That guy! Did I lose him?!

00:11:50.020 --> 00:11:51.140
There he is!

00:11:55.290 --> 00:11:57.950
I'm not sure how much power
this thing has...

00:11:58.990 --> 00:12:00.120
...b- but I'll give it a try!

00:12:00.190 --> 00:12:00.920
Damn Jerid!

00:12:01.190 --> 00:12:05.100
- Is no one... is no one going to fire?!
- I will!

00:12:10.100 --> 00:12:11.090
It turned!

00:12:11.510 --> 00:12:13.000
- Unit 3!
- It's flying?

00:12:13.070 --> 00:12:14.100
What?!

00:12:14.940 --> 00:12:15.770
Jerid!

00:12:16.210 --> 00:12:17.570
There you are! You're not getting away!

00:12:23.520 --> 00:12:24.980
<i>I'm talking to the MP there!</i>

00:12:25.050 --> 00:12:29.150
<i>Shall I give you a lesson on how painful</i>
<i>and frightening it is to be clobbered?!</i>

00:12:41.300 --> 00:12:42.330
You look pathetic!

00:12:44.000 --> 00:12:45.770
What's that guy doing?!

00:12:46.240 --> 00:12:47.540
What's going on?!

00:12:48.610 --> 00:12:50.240
<i>Apolly, stop it! He's not an enemy!</i>

00:12:50.680 --> 00:12:51.610
But...!

00:12:51.680 --> 00:12:53.540
<i>We'll capture both units!</i>

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:55.040
Not so easy!

00:12:55.750 --> 00:12:57.720
That's right! I'm not your enemy!

00:12:57.920 --> 00:12:59.890
<i>I'm on your side!</i>

00:13:01.920 --> 00:13:03.290
Wh-What the...!

00:13:03.720 --> 00:13:04.950
I'll prove it to you!

00:13:06.860 --> 00:13:08.290
- You'll prove it?!
- What?

00:13:19.510 --> 00:13:20.670
That kid...!

00:13:22.910 --> 00:13:25.340
<i>I'm sensing the same vibes</i>
<i>I get from Amuro.</i>

00:13:25.650 --> 00:13:27.140
<i>Who is he?</i>

00:13:27.610 --> 00:13:30.520
That boy knew my name.

00:13:31.480 --> 00:13:32.540
Where could he have found out?

00:13:36.720 --> 00:13:38.250
<i>Open your cockpit!</i>

00:13:38.330 --> 00:13:41.260
<i>Unless you do so,</i>
<i>I'll smash you along with the building!</i>

00:13:41.330 --> 00:13:42.730
Are you okay with that?!

00:13:43.800 --> 00:13:46.320
Why? How could this be happening?!

00:13:46.730 --> 00:13:49.600
<i>Get off, Lieutenant!</i>
<i>Can you hear me?!</i>

00:13:49.670 --> 00:13:53.000
<i>I'm Commander Bright.</i>
<i>Do what the enemy says for now!</i>

00:13:53.240 --> 00:13:54.210
R-Roger!

00:13:54.980 --> 00:13:57.740
Unit 3, I'm taking off!
Can you hear me?!

00:13:58.810 --> 00:13:59.970
Roger that!

00:14:04.150 --> 00:14:05.620
Let me down!

00:14:05.990 --> 00:14:07.280
Damn Titan soldier!

00:14:15.030 --> 00:14:18.620
I think we can trust the Mk. Il Unit 3.

00:14:18.870 --> 00:14:20.730
Get in touch with Roberto!
We're leaving!

00:14:30.740 --> 00:14:33.540
There's little meaning in taking
the Homo Avis winner's cup...

00:14:33.610 --> 00:14:35.140
...or the Mobile Suit plaque.

00:14:45.790 --> 00:14:46.880
L-Lieutenant!

00:14:57.100 --> 00:14:57.930
Another unit?!

00:15:07.710 --> 00:15:09.550
Roberto, are you okay?!

00:15:09.750 --> 00:15:11.080
I'm terribly sorry!

00:15:11.150 --> 00:15:12.580
<i>We're escaping!</i>

00:15:16.020 --> 00:15:17.890
Roberto, don't fall behind!

00:15:22.360 --> 00:15:23.450
My house!

00:15:31.570 --> 00:15:32.500
Fa!

00:15:32.570 --> 00:15:34.560
<i>What's wrong, aren't you coming?</i>

00:15:34.640 --> 00:15:36.110
Yes.

00:15:36.640 --> 00:15:37.580
I'm going with you!

00:15:37.640 --> 00:15:41.550
I hate the Federation Forces,
and hate the Titans even more!

00:15:41.850 --> 00:15:44.650
Good! But be on full alert!

00:15:44.720 --> 00:15:46.740
The Titans pursuit unit
will be coming after us right away!

00:15:52.660 --> 00:15:53.960
Captain Bask!

00:15:54.030 --> 00:15:55.930
It was my first flight in it.

00:15:56.260 --> 00:15:58.660
So I went to battle without any weapons.

00:15:58.730 --> 00:16:01.700
And as you know, the pilot on Unit 3
was not Jerid...!

00:16:01.770 --> 00:16:03.790
I'm having trouble understanding
how someone else was in it.

00:16:04.070 --> 00:16:05.870
What happened to Lieutenant Jerid?

00:16:05.940 --> 00:16:07.270
Captain Bask Om!

00:16:08.210 --> 00:16:11.440
Why was the Gundam Mk. Il
training done here?

00:16:11.750 --> 00:16:15.410
If done at Green Noa 2, we would've
avoided residential damage...!

00:16:19.720 --> 00:16:20.740
Commander Bright!

00:16:20.820 --> 00:16:22.550
Leave him as is!

00:16:23.120 --> 00:16:25.420
A common officer like you
shouldn't talk back!

00:16:25.490 --> 00:16:27.480
This is a Titans base!

00:16:27.560 --> 00:16:29.820
We do things differently from the regular
Federation Forces!

00:16:30.300 --> 00:16:34.760
But the Titans are also
part of the same Federation Forces!

00:16:34.830 --> 00:16:37.770
The main objective of this base is to
defeat the A. E. U. G...

00:16:37.840 --> 00:16:40.570
...who have joined forces
with our enemies the Zeons...

00:16:40.640 --> 00:16:42.540
...to fight against the Earth's government.

00:16:42.740 --> 00:16:44.680
How are we expected to come up
with sufficient tactics...

00:16:44.740 --> 00:16:46.940
...if we have to think first about
the native Spacenoids?

00:16:47.010 --> 00:16:49.950
The more you proceed with plans to
fully convert this colony as your base...

00:16:50.020 --> 00:16:52.810
...the more you're encouraging the
A. E. U. G. to develop.

00:16:52.890 --> 00:16:54.850
Why do you refuse to understand the facts?!

00:16:55.090 --> 00:16:56.780
The Captain is telling you to be quiet!

00:16:57.620 --> 00:16:59.560
Damn you! How dare you
do that to a superior officer!

00:17:00.090 --> 00:17:02.060
We said you're in the Titans territory.

00:17:03.260 --> 00:17:04.860
Your martial law is not in
effect here!

00:17:04.930 --> 00:17:07.130
How could you say that,
after the hostility you've caused!

00:17:07.870 --> 00:17:09.060
You're only a common officer,
so shut up!

00:17:14.910 --> 00:17:15.880
Bastards!

00:17:30.620 --> 00:17:32.390
There are enemy troops
waiting for us at the exit!

00:17:32.460 --> 00:17:33.550
Got that?!

00:17:34.690 --> 00:17:36.320
Unit 3, can you hear me?!

00:17:36.400 --> 00:17:38.490
- You're all right, are you?!
- I'm all right!

00:17:39.670 --> 00:17:41.600
Now there's a huge hole in the colony...

00:17:47.840 --> 00:17:49.780
Don't touch the birdlime!

00:17:52.010 --> 00:17:53.910
Unit 3, you can let go now!

00:17:53.980 --> 00:17:55.950
- Follow me!
- Yes, sir!

00:18:37.760 --> 00:18:39.380
Here they come!

00:18:39.460 --> 00:18:40.790
How impudent!

00:18:43.100 --> 00:18:45.120
<i>Lieutenant Jerid Messa!</i>
<i>Don't overdo it!</i>

00:18:45.400 --> 00:18:47.200
<i>You're still not used to that unit!</i>

00:18:47.270 --> 00:18:49.630
I wish to accomplish my duties
as a member of the Titans!

00:18:49.700 --> 00:18:50.930
Please allow me to!

00:18:51.500 --> 00:18:52.800
Apolly, signal flares!

00:18:52.870 --> 00:18:53.840
<i>Roger!</i>

00:18:55.740 --> 00:18:57.040
Here I go!

00:19:07.990 --> 00:19:10.220
How can he hit me, when I can't hit him?!

00:19:12.330 --> 00:19:14.950
Five... four... three... two...

00:19:15.330 --> 00:19:16.260
One...

00:19:27.210 --> 00:19:29.540
Th-This is not possible!
Th-This can't be!

00:19:34.450 --> 00:19:35.970
Watch out for stray bullets!

00:19:37.050 --> 00:19:38.680
Can you keep up, Unit 3?!

00:19:40.720 --> 00:19:43.280
So that's a real Mega Particle Cannon...!

00:19:43.790 --> 00:19:45.620
This is...!

00:19:45.690 --> 00:19:46.780
What's that?

00:19:50.860 --> 00:19:52.350
The sound...

00:19:52.430 --> 00:19:53.760
...of air leaking?

00:20:00.170 --> 00:20:02.270
Unit 3?! Can you keep up?!

00:20:02.680 --> 00:20:05.300
Yes! I'm all right!

00:20:17.990 --> 00:20:18.960
<i>How are you feeling?</i>

00:20:19.890 --> 00:20:20.860
I'm okay.

00:20:21.260 --> 00:20:22.780
How much time before we can rest?

00:20:22.860 --> 00:20:24.850
<i>I'd say about thirty minutes.</i>

00:20:24.930 --> 00:20:27.130
- Thirty minutes?
<i>- Is something wrong?</i>

00:20:27.200 --> 00:20:29.330
It's just that I'm not
accustomed to outer space!

00:20:52.730 --> 00:20:55.350
There's something very nostalgic about this.

00:21:17.120 --> 00:21:20.920
Titans officer Emma Sheen
arrives at Spaceship Argama.

00:21:21.170 --> 00:21:24.300
She brings a letter with her,
which contains a cruel message.

00:21:24.840 --> 00:21:27.300
Kamille becomes enraged and confused.

00:21:27.510 --> 00:21:29.970
Those actions lead Kamille to witness...

00:21:30.050 --> 00:21:31.760
...the most heartbreaking event.

00:21:32.850 --> 00:21:37.270
Next on Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam,
"Inside the Capsule".

00:21:37.270 --> 00:21:42.280
Inside The Capsule

00:21:37.560 --> 00:21:40.310
You will see the tears of time.
